WEBVTT

00:06.640 --> 00:09.180
Understood, Father.

00:13.090 --> 00:16.510
Your right to succeed the 
throne has been restored?

00:17.900 --> 00:21.730
There was no other choice, with Al gone now.

00:21.730 --> 00:24.120
Um, so... This means...

00:24.120 --> 00:27.830
You'll be the next ruler of the kingdom?

00:27.830 --> 00:29.280
I guess so.

00:29.490 --> 00:32.000
The kingdom's never had 
a queen in charge, though.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.510
The king's spouse has always 
been just a consort...

00:35.740 --> 00:38.350
So I guess I'll have to take 
a prince consort eventually.

00:38.350 --> 00:39.850
A prince consort?

00:39.850 --> 00:42.060
I have to pass down 
the royal blood, after all.

00:44.510 --> 00:50.850
We've still got the much bigger problem 
of getting the nobles to accept me, though!

00:50.850 --> 00:53.710
Even after the right to the throne 
has been restored to you?

00:54.140 --> 00:54.910
Yeah...

00:55.430 --> 00:59.900
No matter how far I get, not being 
able to use magic holds me back.

01:01.690 --> 01:03.990
I think I can be of some help.

01:05.170 --> 01:07.610
As the daughter of Duke Magenta,

01:07.610 --> 01:10.740
I should be able to serve as an intermediary 
between you and the nobles.

01:10.740 --> 01:11.930
That's okay.

01:12.930 --> 01:15.290
This doesn't really have 
anything to do with you two.

01:15.290 --> 01:16.930
You can just take it easy.

01:16.930 --> 01:19.130
N-Nothing to do with...

01:19.710 --> 01:22.240
Euphie's my assistant 
in magicology research,

01:22.240 --> 01:25.100
and Lainie, I guess you're 
a maid-in-training.

01:25.100 --> 01:28.280
This whole issue is totally 
separate from any of that.

01:29.530 --> 01:31.690
Well, I'm gonna head to the workshop.

01:36.080 --> 01:40.520
I thought you would argue 
against what she just said.

01:40.770 --> 01:42.370
Why is that?

01:42.730 --> 01:46.560
I mean... if Miss Anis 
takes a consort... well...

01:48.120 --> 01:49.280
I was...

01:49.860 --> 01:53.120
asked by Prince Algard 
to take care of Miss Anis.

01:53.710 --> 01:57.840
I have to support her 
as one of her subjects.

02:00.450 --> 02:02.610
I... see...

02:17.130 --> 02:20.190
It's okay. I was prepared for this.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.700
I know I can do it.

02:23.590 --> 02:26.330
I am Anisphia Wynn Palettia,

02:26.330 --> 02:29.870
the only princess in this kingdom.

02:30.380 --> 02:31.730
It can't be helped.

02:36.110 --> 02:37.240
It's okay.

02:38.130 --> 02:39.190
It's okay...

04:01.590 --> 04:09.970
The Magical Revolution

04:01.590 --> 04:09.970
The Magical Revolution

04:01.590 --> 04:09.970
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

04:12.050 --> 04:14.440
Honestly, she's such an idiot.

04:14.440 --> 04:17.520
She should just adopt a kid from 
some prominent noble family.

04:17.790 --> 04:20.240
Th-There's no need to put it that way...

04:20.240 --> 04:24.460
Are you concerned about 
Miss Anis becoming queen?

04:24.460 --> 04:25.650
Huh?

04:25.650 --> 04:29.760
Aren't <i>you</i> the one who should be concerned?

04:29.760 --> 04:32.090
No, not in particular...

04:33.540 --> 04:35.500
Be honest.

04:36.070 --> 04:37.700
I am being honest.

04:38.210 --> 04:42.640
It's only right for me to support 
the queen as one of her subjects.

04:43.630 --> 04:44.500
Look—

04:44.500 --> 04:46.130
I'm back!

04:46.130 --> 04:50.070
Er, huh? You're not done with the exam yet?

04:50.360 --> 04:51.050
Hah!

04:51.740 --> 04:57.020
Did you have a nice time 
talking to all those nobles?

04:57.740 --> 05:00.480
Oh, uh... I mean, I guess.

05:00.480 --> 05:03.950
I might actually be better 
at this than I thought...

05:03.950 --> 05:05.160
kinda?

05:06.420 --> 05:09.240
What is that look on your face?

05:09.240 --> 05:11.250
C-Come on.

05:11.250 --> 05:13.190
Insulting my face is uncalled for.

05:13.190 --> 05:14.680
That card's off-limits.

05:15.040 --> 05:18.460
You know very well that's not what I meant!

05:18.740 --> 05:21.960
I just know what my own face 
looks like, that's all.

05:21.960 --> 05:25.680
So long, old me! Say hello to my new normal!

05:26.080 --> 05:27.880
A new you?

05:27.880 --> 05:30.800
I'm Anisphia Wynn Palettia,

05:30.800 --> 05:33.470
the princess who's next 
in line for the throne!

05:41.850 --> 05:42.910
Sorry.

05:42.910 --> 05:45.850
Lady Tilty, please, that's enough.

05:47.070 --> 05:47.820
Idiot!

05:48.210 --> 05:49.780
You are <i>such</i> an idiot!

05:50.200 --> 05:53.820
If that's how you're going to be, 
don't blame me for whatever happens!

06:09.830 --> 06:11.850
So this is where you've been.

06:13.800 --> 06:16.260
Oh... Sorry about earlier.

06:16.740 --> 06:21.200
I was trying to avoid seeing Tilty 
because I knew it'd end up this way.

06:21.200 --> 06:21.720
No, it's...

06:22.060 --> 06:23.540
Don't worry about her.

06:24.290 --> 06:27.770
It's not really fun when she gets mad 
at me over my face, though...

06:29.160 --> 06:30.480
I am worried.

06:30.480 --> 06:31.020
Huh?

06:31.020 --> 06:33.820
What Tilty said was completely out of line,

06:33.820 --> 06:36.230
but you two seemed to be on the same page.

06:40.580 --> 06:43.050
O-Oh, yeah!

06:43.050 --> 06:46.710
More importantly, I gotta go 
pick up Arc-en-Ciel!

06:46.950 --> 06:49.160
A-Arc-en-Ciel?

06:49.160 --> 06:50.800
I was too hard on it,

06:50.800 --> 06:54.130
so I left it with a blacksmith 
in town for maintenance.

06:54.130 --> 06:56.100
Well, see you later!

06:57.980 --> 07:00.990
It's late. You can do that tomorrow.

07:00.990 --> 07:02.970
And I'll be going with you.

07:02.970 --> 07:03.820
Huh?

07:04.470 --> 07:07.490
Your body is not yours alone anymore.

07:07.490 --> 07:09.690
If you wait until something happens, 
it'll be too late.

07:12.610 --> 07:15.830
Are you... talking about a date?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.040
Huh?

07:17.040 --> 07:19.990
Just the two of us, sneaking out on a date?

07:19.990 --> 07:22.380
Just us?! What about guards?

07:22.380 --> 07:24.960
If we guard each other, there's no problem!

07:24.960 --> 07:27.160
That's... But...

07:32.010 --> 07:33.090
Come on, Euphie...

07:34.100 --> 07:34.970
Please?

07:45.210 --> 07:47.020
This way, Euphie.

07:47.430 --> 07:49.470
Yes, Miss Anis.

07:49.470 --> 07:52.360
I mean, um... Anis.

07:53.550 --> 07:55.440
Get used to it quick, Euphie!

08:01.120 --> 08:02.330
You're here.

08:02.830 --> 08:06.300
Oh, Tomas. All done with 
the weapon I left here?

08:06.300 --> 08:07.940
Of course I am.

08:11.260 --> 08:12.260
Who's she?

08:12.670 --> 08:14.360
My assistant!

08:14.960 --> 08:15.830
Oh...

08:16.380 --> 08:18.710
The one who uses that thing, huh?

08:19.390 --> 08:22.340
Pleasure to meet you. My name is Euphie.

08:23.170 --> 08:26.060
I know who you are. Duke Magenta's daughter.

08:26.480 --> 08:30.160
The fiancée Miss Anis swiped 
from Prince Algard, right?

08:30.160 --> 08:32.200
No, no! I didn't swipe her!

08:32.200 --> 08:35.440
We were both in agreement! 
It was a completely legal procedure!

08:35.440 --> 08:38.630
I couldn't care less about 
what nobles are up to.

08:39.720 --> 08:44.080
Who you see here right now is just Euphie, 
so please call me that.

08:46.170 --> 08:48.670
That so? Doesn't sound so bad.

08:48.930 --> 08:50.120
Hang on just a sec.

08:55.330 --> 08:57.060
Pull it out, and check it over.

09:14.720 --> 09:16.310
Um, is something...

09:17.600 --> 09:19.790
My assistant's pretty amazing, isn't she?

09:20.280 --> 09:21.420
Yeah...

09:22.990 --> 09:26.230
I can see why you took a liking to her.

09:28.520 --> 09:31.680
By now, I'm so dependent on Arc-en-Ciel 
that I don't feel right without it.

09:32.020 --> 09:35.140
Thank you for your flawless work, Tomas.

09:35.720 --> 09:37.080
Yeah, sure.

09:42.600 --> 09:45.470
Oh! It's the real Miss Anis!

09:45.470 --> 09:47.780
See? I told you!

09:47.780 --> 09:50.300
Miss Anis! I got some nice, 
fresh fish in today!

09:50.300 --> 09:50.930
Hey!

09:50.930 --> 09:53.410
Let's finish the game we started last time!

09:55.540 --> 09:56.640
Miss Anis!

09:56.640 --> 09:57.960
Come on, please!

09:59.760 --> 10:01.040
Go on.

10:01.440 --> 10:05.230
I'll just do some final checks on this 
and then give it to Euphie.

10:06.930 --> 10:09.180
Sorry! I won't be long!

10:10.100 --> 10:12.600
Come on, take turns!

10:18.000 --> 10:20.630
Tell me one thing.

10:21.050 --> 10:22.340
All right...

10:23.330 --> 10:26.340
Will our next ruler be Miss Anis?

10:29.840 --> 10:31.750
I believe so, yes.

10:33.270 --> 10:34.600
I see.

10:34.600 --> 10:38.970
Are you that uneasy with the idea 
of Miss Anis being queen?

10:40.440 --> 10:42.250
I'm not uneasy.

10:42.250 --> 10:45.320
She comes to visit the town 
pretty frequently.

10:46.080 --> 10:50.440
There are a lot of folks who 
believe she can be trusted.

10:51.010 --> 10:54.620
But you don't seem very happy about it.

10:54.620 --> 10:56.480
Yeah, I'm not.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.700
Why is that?

10:58.920 --> 11:00.490
You have no ide—

11:01.430 --> 11:03.480
Look at all the stuff they gave me!

11:03.480 --> 11:05.140
You can have some of it, Tomas.

11:08.060 --> 11:09.360
Did something happen?

11:09.360 --> 11:12.220
Nope. We're done talking.

11:13.520 --> 11:14.620
Go on home.

11:28.350 --> 11:29.340
Oh...

11:29.660 --> 11:31.340
Thank you.

11:31.790 --> 11:33.740
Has something happened?

11:33.740 --> 11:34.620
Huh?

11:35.260 --> 11:39.030
You've seemed out of sorts 
since you returned from town.

11:41.120 --> 11:44.830
I'm just... not sure I understand anymore.

11:48.750 --> 11:53.380
I really believe that Miss Anis 
will be a queen

11:53.380 --> 11:56.830
who can bring the nobles and 
the commoners together...

11:58.470 --> 12:00.640
Don't you think so, too?

12:00.860 --> 12:03.120
I think she will be a benevolent ruler.

12:04.190 --> 12:05.250
But...

12:05.790 --> 12:07.650
She probably isn't cut out for it.

12:09.790 --> 12:13.080
Having power and being forced 
to use it are not the same.

12:13.580 --> 12:15.660
If the princess becomes queen,

12:15.660 --> 12:19.410
she won't be able to go into 
town anymore, will she?

12:19.630 --> 12:20.940
Well...

12:21.560 --> 12:24.020
But she has a responsibility,

12:24.440 --> 12:26.490
so I suppose she has no choice...

12:29.150 --> 12:31.040
Come with me, please.

12:47.580 --> 12:49.910
Did Miss Anis do all this?

12:51.120 --> 12:55.370
The princess may act like a wild child 
with no concept of good sense,

12:55.370 --> 12:58.960
but at her core, she is a 
very conscientious person.

12:58.960 --> 13:01.180
That is true, but...

13:02.080 --> 13:05.000
In order to be a ruler accepted by all,

13:05.550 --> 13:08.760
she will probably never associate 
with magicology again.

13:09.060 --> 13:10.540
But that's...

13:11.220 --> 13:13.620
She takes too much upon herself.

13:14.200 --> 13:16.690
That hasn't changed since she was little.

13:17.090 --> 13:18.710
If she becomes queen...

13:20.020 --> 13:23.600
she will most likely throw away 
what is precious to her.

13:28.420 --> 13:29.790
But...

13:29.790 --> 13:33.250
I am the daughter of Duke Magenta.

13:33.670 --> 13:37.720
I have my duty as a noble... 
as part of a royal household.

13:38.320 --> 13:40.920
Once the princess has fulfilled her duty...

13:43.620 --> 13:46.850
Do you think she will smile happily?

13:51.180 --> 13:54.400
That... That's not...

13:56.320 --> 13:58.620
But... why...

13:59.500 --> 14:00.530
do I...

14:10.230 --> 14:11.370
So...

14:11.870 --> 14:14.390
Not knowing what else to do,

14:14.390 --> 14:17.170
you came all the way here to talk to me?

14:17.500 --> 14:18.510
Yes.

14:20.820 --> 14:25.310
I just... want to help her.

14:25.560 --> 14:28.250
I don't want to see her sad.

14:28.560 --> 14:33.000
It just hurts so much that I can't solve 
Miss Anis's problems for her.

14:35.430 --> 14:37.650
"Miss Anis's problems"?

14:37.900 --> 14:40.110
That's your first mistake.

14:40.270 --> 14:41.330
Huh?

14:41.870 --> 14:45.030
This is actually <i>your</i> problem, isn't it?

14:45.790 --> 14:47.470
Mine?

14:47.470 --> 14:50.060
Yes, an issue of your own feelings.

14:50.320 --> 14:52.870
What are you really thinking right now?

14:56.590 --> 14:57.960
Say it.

14:58.350 --> 15:00.650
But... I...

15:01.000 --> 15:02.380
Say it!

15:04.430 --> 15:06.600
It's my duty to support the royal family,

15:07.690 --> 15:09.350
but I personally...

15:13.010 --> 15:17.150
don't want Miss Anis to become queen.

15:20.980 --> 15:24.950
Having your heart at odds with 
your duty was painful, wasn't it?

15:26.390 --> 15:30.230
I know this feeling I have is wrong.

15:31.070 --> 15:34.700
What does it matter 
whether it's right or wrong?

15:36.650 --> 15:41.880
Just try to find the path 
that you truly want to take.

15:43.420 --> 15:46.830
Can I really... have hope?

15:47.240 --> 15:49.500
If that's what you've decided to do,

15:49.500 --> 15:51.790
there's no one who can stop you.

15:52.530 --> 15:56.500
You're the most brilliant genius young lady 
in this kingdom, aren't you?

16:07.640 --> 16:10.330
It's unusual for you to visit my office,

16:10.630 --> 16:11.570
Euphie.

16:12.030 --> 16:14.430
There's something I wish 
to consult you about.

16:14.430 --> 16:17.250
Oh? That's even more unusual.

16:19.650 --> 16:24.620
Does the kingdom's next ruler 
absolutely have to be Miss Anis?

16:26.330 --> 16:28.790
Why do you ask that?

16:31.750 --> 16:35.620
Because I don't want Miss Anis to be queen.

16:41.020 --> 16:44.140
A kingdom is only a kingdom 
if it has a monarch.

16:44.640 --> 16:50.120
Princess Anisphia must fulfill her duty 
in order to protect this kingdom.

16:50.120 --> 16:53.190
And it's your job to support her.

16:53.190 --> 16:54.190
Am I wrong?

16:55.140 --> 16:56.520
I...

16:59.730 --> 17:02.950
Even so, I cannot accept it.

17:03.230 --> 17:04.120
Why?

17:04.590 --> 17:07.830
Because that is not where 
Miss Anis can truly smile!

17:11.390 --> 17:12.350
Smile?

17:12.760 --> 17:16.050
Are you saying that's more important 
than our kingdom's future?

17:16.490 --> 17:20.020
This kingdom, and all of its people,

17:20.520 --> 17:24.350
cannot be traded for just one 
person's smile. I realize that.

17:25.540 --> 17:26.890
But still...

17:27.110 --> 17:29.360
I don't want to accept it as 
just the way things must be!

17:32.550 --> 17:35.990
Is this out of devotion or obligation?

17:35.990 --> 17:37.940
Or is it sympathy?

17:40.420 --> 17:43.620
I just... love her.

17:46.320 --> 17:49.930
Even if I lose my position, my family, 
and everything I have,

17:49.930 --> 17:51.800
my feelings won't change.

17:53.170 --> 17:57.250
You truly care that much 
for Princess Anisphia?

17:58.860 --> 17:59.720
Yes.

18:03.260 --> 18:05.200
As Duke Magenta,

18:05.200 --> 18:08.360
I cannot, under any circumstances, 
accept these misplaced feelings of yours.

18:10.870 --> 18:12.310
I know that.

18:12.310 --> 18:16.230
But while I am fully aware 
that it isn't right,

18:16.230 --> 18:17.390
I can no longer...

18:25.710 --> 18:30.580
Long ago, Orphanse loved gardening 
more than anyone else.

18:31.190 --> 18:36.130
He even declared that his dream was to 
become a common subject and study plants.

18:36.130 --> 18:39.990
He was no less of a problem child 
than Princess Anisphia herself.

18:40.570 --> 18:44.220
But he threw away his dream of happiness.

18:44.220 --> 18:47.900
All to stop the nobles' uprising 
and become king.

18:47.900 --> 18:50.280
And I supported him with all my strength.

18:50.900 --> 18:52.410
For our kingdom's sake.

18:54.900 --> 18:56.080
However...

18:56.570 --> 19:01.780
The truth is, at that time, 
we had another option.

19:02.500 --> 19:03.750
You mean...

19:09.790 --> 19:13.090
Spirits? But why...

19:31.600 --> 19:33.950
I wish you wouldn't show up without notice.

19:34.900 --> 19:36.640
It's been a long time.

19:37.630 --> 19:40.110
You've aged quite a bit, Grantz.

19:40.110 --> 19:42.590
And you don't seem to have changed at all.

19:43.050 --> 19:44.960
What brings you here?

19:44.960 --> 19:47.060
You've already figured it out, haven't you?

19:47.060 --> 19:48.920
Aren't you going to introduce me?

19:51.930 --> 19:53.370
This lady...

19:53.370 --> 19:55.850
is Miss Lumi, a spirit contractor.

19:56.600 --> 19:58.710
Spirit contractor?

20:02.160 --> 20:05.190
Um... Shall I leave you two alone?

20:05.190 --> 20:07.200
Oh, my, no.

20:07.760 --> 20:10.430
I came here to see <i>you</i>, after all.

20:10.770 --> 20:11.650
Huh?

20:12.150 --> 20:14.100
Tell me, Euphyllia...

20:14.480 --> 20:18.560
What does a spirit contract 
signify in this kingdom?

20:18.830 --> 20:21.030
Eh? Um...

20:21.270 --> 20:25.510
Forging a contract with a greater spirit 
that possesses immense power

20:25.510 --> 20:28.670
signifies one's authority 
as a member of the royal family.

20:29.710 --> 20:34.150
From the legend of the founder 
and first king of Palettia, yes?

20:34.410 --> 20:37.130
Those who have entered a spirit contract

20:37.130 --> 20:39.950
are capable of starting a new royal dynasty.

20:41.270 --> 20:42.340
Yes...

20:42.700 --> 20:45.790
One could even overtake the 
legitimate heir to the throne

20:46.260 --> 20:47.760
and become a new monarch.

20:48.820 --> 20:50.220
You mean...

20:51.940 --> 20:54.860
If I were to enter a spirit contract

20:54.860 --> 20:57.430
and earn the acknowledgment of the nobles,

20:57.710 --> 20:59.730
Miss Anis wouldn't have to become queen?

20:59.730 --> 21:00.720
Don't!

21:01.850 --> 21:03.150
I don't...

21:03.150 --> 21:04.160
Yes.

21:04.520 --> 21:07.960
You declined to enter a contract, Grantz.

21:08.610 --> 21:11.590
You were going to enter a spirit contract?

21:12.080 --> 21:14.330
I met the requirements,

21:14.330 --> 21:15.970
and I didn't want to do it.

21:17.190 --> 21:18.370
That's it.

21:19.430 --> 21:20.990
Why not?

21:21.370 --> 21:27.760
A spirit contract is not the wonderful thing 
that the people of this kingdom think it is.

21:32.840 --> 21:36.490
Oh, dear. What an unpleasant 
look in your eyes.

21:36.490 --> 21:40.390
I'm very sorry, 
but I would do anything to...

21:42.070 --> 21:44.870
Your feelings are that strong?

21:45.850 --> 21:48.950
How very, very cruel.

21:49.430 --> 21:50.920
Miss Lumi?

21:50.920 --> 21:53.860
I came here to stop you.

21:54.310 --> 21:56.590
To make sure the same mistake 
wouldn't be repeated.

21:59.320 --> 22:03.980
Let me tell you... a certain story.

22:02.460 --> 22:04.970
Episode Ten







The Royal Succession of Resignation and Fury

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
Episode Eleven







The Spirit Contract of Despair and Determination
